            "id": 82517,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sıralama listeyi değiştirir; bu nedenle listeyi <code>print(scores)</code> ile yeniden kullandığımızda veya görüntülediğimizde sıralanmış olarak görünür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 3, 6, 12]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>print(scores)</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
