            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kullanıcıların haftalık sayılarını sıralamak için <code>active_users</code>, bir nokta <code>.</code> ve <code>sort()</code> yaz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"active_users = [\" /><text value=\"103\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"140\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"288\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"active_users.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(active_users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[103, 140, 200, 288]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>active_users</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve sonra <code>sort</code>, <code>()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>active_users</code> listesindeki haftalık kullanıcı sayılarını küçükten büyüğe sırala. Böylece kod <code>[103, 140, 200, 288]</code> yazdırsın.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"active_users = [\" /><text value=\"103\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"140\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"288\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"active_users.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(active_users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"order\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"sorted\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[103, 140, 200, 288]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>active_users</code>, ardından <code>.</code>, <code>sort</code> ve son olarak <code>()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
